ConfigMap is a concept from kubernetes used to store configuration data seperately from application code which stores the data like variables, environment, port,files
it is used becoz the code keeps clean and can be reused
seperation b/w app. code and configuration data
makes it easy to change configs without rebuilding containers
helps manage different environments
difference b/w config & app
         config                                                        application
 contains the settings r data used by the program/app         contains the actual code of the app.
  it can be changed frequently                                cannot be changed frequently
  kept outside using ConfigMaps r secretes                    built into the container/image                              
  contains coustamizable values                                contains bussiness logics
  ex : variables,port                                             ex : java,python
